<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">früntlich</unclear> willig dienst, unnd was wir ehren, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">liebe</unclear>,
