<lb n="4"/>Nachdem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sider</unclear> etlich tagen her etliche <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gatungen</unclear> gar <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geringer</unclear>
